格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Self-evolving agent framework on DeepSeek Harness (dsh): 40 Cordis plugins, 4 presets, memory · reflection · gates · metrics · an auditable evolution loop.","id":"gh:1337330354","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"DSH-AGINT","slug":"Anmulzhao/DSH-AGINT","topics":["agent-framework","agent-memory","agi","agint","ai-agent","autonomous-agents","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","llm-agent","plugin-system","self-evolving"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Self-evolving agent framework on DeepSeek Harness (dsh): 40 Cordis plugins, 4 presets, memory · refl"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ection · gates · metrics · an auditable evolution loop."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# AGINT"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> 基于 DeepSeek Harness (dsh) 的**自进化智能体框架**。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**v0.26.0** · 39 个插件已挂载（39 条挂载声明）· 1 套 preset · 25 个工具行 · 10 个 skills · 27 个 cron job。\n数字取自仓库级判据：版本看"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" `VERSION` 表首行，插件看 `node bin/verify-manifests.mjs`，其余看 `AGENTS.md` 文末 LOCAL-STATE 块。实时运行数字不在本文件。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **哲学**：美 = 简洁 + 真实 + 靠谱 + 主动 + 安全；冲突时取前者。\n- **定位**：dsh 是上游 runtime。AGINT 是它上面的规范与插件集合，不是 fork，也不是 "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"AGI 实现。它提供记忆 / 反思 / 约束 / 度量 / 评估的工程骨架。新功能必须过 D-QAF 评估。\n- **宪法**：D-QAF 四阶段流水线 + HARM 四维指标 + 进化记忆层，见 `"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"docs/evolution-framework.md`。默认自动化，人工审批只兜底。新机制自带 kill-switch、出厂即开、配齐降级与审计出口。"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 四层结构"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| 层 | 内容 | 位置 |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| **bundle** | `@agint/host`：全部插件 + 挂载 patch | `package.json` + `cordis.patch.yml` |\n| **preset** | "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"智进人格 + 工具集 + skills，1 套 `agint` | `presets/agint/` |\n| **plugin** | 39 个已挂载插件，8 组（记忆 / 调度 / 反思 / 质量 "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"/ 闭环 / 执行 / 观测 / 感知） | `plugins/agint-*/` |\n| **data** | 记忆 / 规则 / 指标 / 梦境 / 复盘 | runtime 数据，不进仓库 |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> 三个子 preset（`agint-blockchain` / `agint-investor` / `agint-ops`）2026-10-26 起拆到私有仓 `agint-presets`，以"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" `@agint/presets` 交付。先装本仓，再装它。"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 安装"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"前置：Node.js ≥ 20 · python3 · dsh ≥ 0.1.7-rc.1（矩阵见 `VERSION`）· 目标 profile 已初始化。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"装完**必须重启目标 profile**。bundle 与 profile 层不热更新。卸载 `./install/uninstall.sh`。"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> 一份 preset 服务所有 profile：`$DSH_HOME/.agent-presets/agint/` 只有一份，web 与 desktop 共用。25 行工具声明锚定 `.agint-"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"bundle/plugins/`，不随 `--profile` 变化。安装器逐条核验 25 个目标，缺一个即报。"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"四条红线："},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. 升 dsh 必须带精确版本号。`npm i -g @deepseek-ai/dsh@latest` 会静默降级。\n2. 包内 `node_modules` junction 指向 dsh 官方包"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"。`rm -rf` 会跟进删包，卸载时必须保留。\n3. 装完像没装且零报错，多半是没注册进 `dsh.profile.bundles`（安装步骤 3.5）。\n4. `cordis.patch.yml`"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" 的 `!!js` 只能写成标量。写成块集合或模板会让整份 bundle patch 解析失败，dsh 静默跳过 `@agint/host` 且界面无报错。改完跑 `node bin/check-pa"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"标量。写成块集合或模板会让整份 bundle patch 解析失败，dsh 静默跳过 `@agint/host` 且界面无报错。改完跑 `node bin/check-patch-yaml.mjs`。"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"更多排障见 `docs/dsh-integration.md`；容器部署走 `docker/`。"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 仓库自检"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"改完插件按序跑四步："},{"id":"p21s1","text":"1. `node bin/check-patch-yaml.mjs` —— patch YAML 可解析。\n2. `node bin/check-wiring.mjs` —— 接线通电。\n3. `no"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"de bin/check-dsh-compat.mjs` —— dsh 兼容。\n4. `node bin/check-boundary.mjs` —— 能力边界未越界。"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"其余自检（manifest / tool schema / 记忆层 / LOCAL-STATE 回写）用法见 `bin/` 下脚本。"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 文档地图"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| 想看什么 | 去哪 |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| 运行现状（真实数字，权威） | `AGENTS.md` 文末 LOCAL-STATE 块 |\n| 架构 / 插件详细 | `docs/architecture.md` · `docs/plugin"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"s/` |\n| dsh 集成 / 安装排障 | `docs/dsh-integration.md` |\n| 安全边界 / kill-switch 清单 | `docs/security-boundar"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"y.md` |\n| 能力归属 / 越界判据 | `docs/capability-boundary.md` |\n| **已知盲区（先看这个再下结论）** | `docs/known-limitatio"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ns/` |\n| 运维 SOP / 踩坑 / 评估场景 | `docs/operations/` · `docs/lessons/` · `eval/scenarios/` |\n| 路线图 / 变更日"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"志 / PHILOSOPHY | GitHub Wiki |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"环境变量三个：`DSH_HOME`（数据根，默认 `$HOME/.dsh`）· `AGINT_PROFILE`（`install.sh` 目标 profile，缺省 `web`）· `AGINT_HO"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ME`（**双语义**：安装器当源码根、插件当数据根；设错会把数据写进仓库目录，见 `docker/entrypoint.sh`）。"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 许可"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
